Pipeline output for the examples of GitHub Flavored Markdown 0.29-gfm.
Written by crates/mdcore/tests/conformance.rs; do not edit by hand.
Regenerate with EZMARK_BLESS=1 cargo test -p mdcore --test conformance
and read the diff. tests/pipeline/README.md explains the differences.
A tab is shown as → in the markdown, as in the spec.

670 examples: 354 same as the spec once block markers are set aside, 316 differ.

======== example 1: Tabs (same as the spec)
→foo→baz→→bim
-------- pipeline output
<ezmark-block key="8df44c3b1fb6c8be"></ezmark-block>
<pre><code>foo	baz		bim
</code></pre>

